print screen region win + shift + SPower User Menu ShortcutTo start, press Win + X to open the Power User Menu. You'll notice underlined characters corresponding to shortcut keys for the options on this menu. Press U to expand the Shut down or sign out section, then use one of the following keys to shut down, sleep, or perform other power actions:Press U again to shut down Windows.Hit the R key to restart.Press S to put Windows to sleep.Use H to hibernate.Hit I to sign out.